<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown cuts Oakley.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown cuts Oakley.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it cut Oakley Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock tumbled 4-3/8 to 11 by mid-morning following a warning that it expected its fourth quarter earnings to fall below the Wall Street consensus of $0.16 per share.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
